inner than the numbers know, while Villarreal's missing Foyth and Gerard Moreno roughly cancel each other out; a mild lean up to about 4.4."},"corners":{"lean":"same","adjust_pct":0,"call":"Around 11 corners","text":"The numbers say 10.7 corners and already add Villarreal's high recent corner count (41 in six). Barcelona will dominate the ball with Lamine Yamal and Raphinha (fit after returning from Brazil), and Villarreal's wide men Moleiro and Buchanan are available; the defensive changes don't alter either side's approach, so I stay at 10.7."},"cards":{"lean":"same","adjust_pct":0,"call":"Around 5 cards, under 6.5","text":"The numbers say 4.7 cards: they add Villarreal's busy recent card record (15 in six) and about 6% for referee Hernández Hernández, who shows 4.9 cards a game. The match has no derby or table edge and Renato Veiga is one booking from a ban, which may make him careful; nothing the numbers miss, so I keep 4.7."},"shots":{"lean":"same","adjust_pct":0,"call":"Around 28 shots","text":"The numbers say 28.2 shots, with both sides' recent shooting already added. Barcelona's front line of Yamal, Fermín, Raphinha and Adeyemi or Gordon is at full strength; Flick spoke about managing minutes in a nine-games-in-28-days run, but Wednesday's opponent is Sabah, so heavy rotation here is unlikely. These roughly balance, so I stay at 28.2."},"shots_on_target":{"lean":"same","adjust_pct":0,"call":"Around 10.6 shots on target","text":"The numbers say 10.6 shots on target, already raised for Barcelona's recent accuracy (40 on target in six). Villarreal without Gerard Moreno create a little less, while a Barcelona defence without Christensen and possibly Cubarsí may let Mikautadze in a bit more; no clear reason to move it, so 10.6."},"sources":["https://www.infobae.com/espana/agencias/2026/11/21/flick-asegura-que-cubarsi-podria-empezar-en-el-banquillo-y-confirma-la-baja-de-christensen/","https://www.prensalibre.com/deportes/futbol-internacional/flick-confirma-bajas-e